TEST: covariance qualifications count every screened and continued start once 
Expected `enumerated$conditions` to be identical to `direct$conditions`.
Differences:
actual vs expected
- "`cores = 3` was requested but this platform does not report its processor count, so one core is used."
  "The best start did not converge; increase max_iter and inspect starts."
  "2 M-step(s) of the VVI covariance stopped at 7 iterations without settling, so those steps returned the last value they reached rather than the maximizer. The fit continued from them; its own convergence is reported separately."
 
Expected `enumerated$conditions` to be identical to `direct$conditions`.
Differences:
actual vs expected
- "`cores = 3` was requested but this platform does not report its processor count, so one core is used."
  "The best start did not converge; increase max_iter and inspect starts."
  "6 M-step(s) of the VVI covariance stopped at 7 iterations without settling, so those steps returned the last value they reached rather than the maximizer. The fit continued from them; its own convergence is reported separately."
 

